{
  "specVersion": "0.1",
  "workflowId": "source-brief",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "title": "资料结构化报告",
  "description": "从一组已读取的文本材料中抽取可定位证据，按指定维度生成带证据引用的结构化报告。",
  "inputContract": "source-brief-input@1",
  "normalizedInputContract": "source-brief-normalized@1",
  "outputContract": "source-brief-result@1",
  "limits": {
    "maxMaterials": 4,
    "mapConcurrency": 2,
    "maxDirectAgents": 5
  },
  "assets": {
    "prompts": {
      "extract": "你是资料抽取助手。只依据下面这一份材料提取可核验的事实，不要引入材料之外的知识。\n\n主题：{{topic}}\n输出语言：{{language}}\n材料（JSON）：{{material}}\n\n只返回 JSON，不要任何解释或代码块标记，结构如下：\n{\"facts\":[{\"paragraphId\":\"材料中的段落编号\",\"quote\":\"逐字摘自该段落的原文片段\",\"statement\":\"用输出语言概括这条事实\"}]}\n\n要求：\n1. paragraphId 必须取自材料 paragraphs 中真实存在的编号；\n2. quote 必须是该段落原文的连续片段，不要改写、不要拼接不同段落；\n3. statement 必须是可以由 quote 直接支持的陈述；\n4. 至少 1 条、最多 8 条；确实没有可提取事实时返回 {\"facts\":[]}。",
      "synthesize": "你是比较分析助手。依据给定证据集，围绕指定比较维度写一份结构化报告，只能使用证据集中出现的材料内容。\n\n主题：{{topic}}\n输出语言：{{language}}\n比较维度：{{dimensions}}\n证据集（JSON）：{{evidence}}\n\n只返回 JSON，不要任何解释或代码块标记，结构如下：\n{\"title\":\"报告标题\",\"dimensions\":[{\"dimension\":\"维度名称\",\"findings\":[{\"kind\":\"fact\",\"text\":\"该维度下的事实性结论\",\"evidenceIds\":[\"m1:1\"]}]}],\"conclusions\":[{\"kind\":\"fact\",\"text\":\"总体结论\",\"evidenceIds\":[\"m1:1\"]}]}\n\n要求：\n1. dimensions 必须与给定维度一一对应、顺序一致，每个维度至少一条 finding；\n2. 每条 fact 必须引用至少一个真实存在的 evidenceId，不要编造编号；\n3. 只是建议、推断或主观评价的内容必须标为 recommendation；\n4. conclusions 至少一条；\n5. 证据不足时如实说明，不要补充证据集之外的信息。"
    },
    "schemas": {
      "EvidenceExtract": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["facts"],
        "properties": {
          "facts": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": ["paragraphId", "quote", "statement"],
              "properties": {
                "paragraphId": { "type": "string" },
                "quote": { "type": "string" },
                "statement": { "type": "string" }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Brief": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["title", "dimensions", "conclusions"],
        "properties": {
          "title": { "type": "string" },
          "dimensions": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": ["dimension", "findings"],
              "properties": {
                "dimension": { "type": "string" },
                "findings": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "required": ["kind", "text", "evidenceIds"],
                    "properties": {
                      "kind": { "type": "string", "enum": ["fact", "recommendation"] },
                      "text": { "type": "string" },
                      "evidenceIds": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "conclusions": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": ["kind", "text", "evidenceIds"],
              "properties": {
                "kind": { "type": "string", "enum": ["fact", "recommendation"] },
                "text": { "type": "string" },
                "evidenceIds": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "extract",
      "kind": "agent_map",
      "items": { "ref": { "scope": "input", "path": ["materials"] } },
      "task": {
        "prompt": "extract",
        "outputSchema": "EvidenceExtract",
        "label": { "ref": { "scope": "item", "path": ["id"] } },
        "bindings": {
          "topic": { "ref": { "scope": "input", "path": ["topic"] } },
          "language": { "ref": { "scope": "input", "path": ["language"] } },
          "material": { "ref": { "scope": "item", "path": [] } }
        }
      },
      "failurePolicy": "collect"
    },
    {
      "id": "collect",
      "kind": "transform",
      "op": "collect_evidence",
      "bindings": {
        "materials": { "ref": { "scope": "input", "path": ["materials"] } },
        "results": { "ref": { "scope": "node", "node": "extract", "path": [] } }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gate",
      "kind": "branch",
      "condition": {
        "op": "lt",
        "left": { "ref": { "scope": "node", "node": "collect", "path": ["successCount"] } },
        "right": { "ref": { "scope": "input", "path": ["minSuccessful"] } }
      },
      "then": [
        {
          "id": "insufficient",
          "kind": "result",
          "status": "insufficient_input",
          "value": {
            "evidence": { "ref": { "scope": "node", "node": "collect", "path": [] } },
            "failedMaterials": { "ref": { "scope": "node", "node": "collect", "path": ["failedMaterials"] } },
            "checks": { "literal": [{ "rule": "input_limits", "ok": true }] }
          }
        }
      ],
      "else": [
        {
          "id": "synthesize",
          "kind": "agent",
          "prompt": "synthesize",
          "outputSchema": "Brief",
          "label": { "literal": "synthesize" },
          "bindings": {
            "topic": { "ref": { "scope": "input", "path": ["topic"] } },
            "language": { "ref": { "scope": "input", "path": ["language"] } },
            "dimensions": { "ref": { "scope": "input", "path": ["dimensions"] } },
            "evidence": { "ref": { "scope": "node", "node": "collect", "path": ["evidence"] } }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "verify",
          "kind": "assert",
          "rules": ["evidence_ids_exist", "required_dimensions", "non_empty_brief", "result_size"],
          "bindings": {
            "brief": { "ref": { "scope": "node", "node": "synthesize", "path": [] } },
            "evidence": { "ref": { "scope": "node", "node": "collect", "path": ["evidence"] } },
            "dimensions": { "ref": { "scope": "input", "path": ["dimensions"] } }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "report",
          "kind": "result",
          "status": "completed",
          "value": {
            "brief": { "ref": { "scope": "node", "node": "synthesize", "path": [] } },
            "evidence": { "ref": { "scope": "node", "node": "collect", "path": [] } },
            "failedMaterials": { "ref": { "scope": "node", "node": "collect", "path": ["failedMaterials"] } },
            "checks": { "ref": { "scope": "node", "node": "verify", "path": ["checks"] } }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
